#TeamMcGovern hit the road today—rallying Mainers in Lewiston to get out and vote for @dunlap4congress!!

@mainepaullepage calls social security “welfare.” Newsflash Paul: our seniors worked hard & paid into social security for decades. They earned it.

Matt will fight for our seniors, defend their right to social security, and ensure they can grow old with dignity. Let’s send him to Congress!
